  "extractionNotes": "Formal refusal decision citing UZ art. 2a: on the day the right arose (2025-09-25) the contribution debt exceeded 1% of the minimum wage (46.66) and was not repaid. The amount of the debt is not stated anywhere; recorded as aboveThreshold. Repayment date blank in the memo. Child birth date redacted on the ZAO and absent elsewhere, so event.date is omitted although the event has happened. Declared bases: 1290.00 in 2024-12 (30% of 4300) and 1399.80 in 2025 (30% of 4666), confirming the 2024-07 and 2025 minimum wages. The memo flags that the base was below 60% of the forecast wage (last such month 2025-08). Days derived from the printed refusal period. Adjudication: unpaid arrears at the decision date give a refusal (ARREARS_UNPAID)."
